### OpenAPI 调用 Demo（IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client）
### 先启动 whl-openapi-server（8081），并执行 update_openapi_client.sql

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/openapi
@clientId = a8f3c2e1b9d0476581920abcdef12345
@tenantId = 000000

### 1. 登录（openapi 客户端，无验证码）
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
  "grantType": "password",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}
@authClientId = {{login.response.body.data.client_id}}

### 2. 规范样例 · 只读（adapter → Facade → biz）
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/demo/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
clientid: {{authClientId}}

### 3. 创建订单（写操作 · Command + idempotencyKey）
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/scm/demo/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
clientid: {{authClientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "http-demo-001",
  "warehouseCode": "WH01",
  "lines": [{ "skuCode": "DEMO-SKU", "qty": 2 }]
}

###
@orderNo = {{createOrder.response.body.data.orderNo}}

### 4. 确认订单（跨域：OMS → Inventory → Event → WMS）
POST {{baseUrl}}/scm/demo/orders/{{orderNo}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
clientid: {{authClientId}}

### 5. 快照（调试）
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/demo/snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
clientid: {{authClientId}}

### 6. 发货（将 taskNo 替换为上一步 snapshot 中的值）
@taskNo = OT000001
POST {{baseUrl}}/scm/demo/outbound-tasks/{{taskNo}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
clientid: {{authClientId}}
